<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Orix in bonus announcement.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Orix in bonus announcement.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombo blue chip Lanka Orix Leasing Co Ltd announced a bonus issue of one new share for every five held, a stock exchange statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company's issued share capital will rise accordingly to 10.8 million ordinary shares, from nine million.</p>
<p>Lanka Orix Leasing is a dedicated leasing company and an associate of Japan's Orix Corporation.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
